/T (Once we run the application we are redirected to the website and the routes are activated firstly. Then, a controller is called to send and receive information from the classification and segmentation models. Inside the models, we have the user model which calls an external database that stores all the registered users. Finally, the controller calls the view that displays the results on the website. )
